  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1501.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1501.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this chapter is to establish criteria and procedures by which waste-derived products, as defined by Env-Sw 104, shall be certified for distribution and use.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3201.01); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
